  "label": "Erdoğan is mapped onto the goblin-like figure",
  "description": "The text 'apparently not erdogan' explicitly maps the Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdoğan onto the grotesque, goblin-like visual entity. The meme uses the visual metaphor of a monstrous, non-human creature to represent Erdoğan, implying he is not human or is monstrous. This is a dehumanizing analogical mapping where the textual reference to Erdoğan is projected onto the visual entity (goblin_like_figure) to convey contempt and hatred.",
